<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian treasury auction raises 85 million dinars.</title>
<headline>Tunisian treasury auction raises 85 million dinars.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it sold 85 million dinars of three-year notes at its weekly auction on December 17, repaying maturing paper totalling 77.99 million dinars.</p>
<p>The three-year notes payable in equal annual tranches were at a 8.0 percent coupon rate, unchanged from the lowest yield at last week's auction.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 318.9 million dinars of three-, four-, five- and seven-year paper at between 8.0 and 8.5 percent.</p>
<p>($=one dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
